    "answer": {
      "short": "$y=-(4-x)^5$, $y'=5(4-x)^4$.",
      "worked": "$\\begin{align*}y&=(4-x)^2\\bigl(-(4-x)\\bigr)^3\\\\y&=-(4-x)^5\\\\y'&=-5(4-x)^4(-1)\\\\y'&=5(4-x)^4.\\end{align*}$",
